      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Nameatic's first release.

- Drag in a batch of videos, then rename them one by one while each
  clip plays: type a name, press Return, and the next clip starts.
- ↑ / ↓ move through the batch without saving; ⌘⌫ moves a clip to
  the Trash. File extensions are kept for you.
- Audio is leveled across the batch, so quiet and loud clips play
  at roughly the same volume.
- Smooth playback with AirPods and other Bluetooth headphones.

Requires macOS 26 Tahoe on an Apple silicon Mac.
]]></description>
